("p", "Each work in the corpus proves, for its domain, three theorems of a fixed type. First, an exact criterion with obstruction: the lift exists if and only if the obstruction vanishes, and otherwise a canonical datum locates the first failure. Second, a frontier with a dual lower bound: a Pareto curve of rate against distortion, with the lower bound supplied by duality — never by construction. Third, constructive synthesis with a hardness wall: a width-parameterized algorithm attaining the frontier, plus a proof that the parameterization is optimal, so that no cheaper route exists."),
("p", "The instances cover every domain. The causal-descent pair contributes the diagnostics and obstruction datum, the Bell repair profiles, and the certifying dynamic program over tree decompositions, with NP-completeness, W[2]-hardness, and ETH-tightness as its wall. The transduction manuscript contributes the Myhill–Nerode and Hankel-rank criteria, the AAK/Nehari-type converses, and the Schmidt-pair truncation ladders — each step certified by the next singular value. The combs paper contributes the intercept principle as its exact criterion and affine non-representability as its obstruction; the channels paper contributes exact diamond-ball geometry, antipodal widths as dual lower bounds in the tradition of Borsuk–Ulam, and query-uniform compression bounds as its frontier; the instruments paper completes the flat-width classification — the exact criterion for the whole affine interface. The circuits manuscript contributes the statistical face — Born-record large deviations — with Z3 exact closure as its certified computation and a PostBQP result as its wall. The metabolic pair contributes an empirical frontier, and the governance corpus its minimax dual certificates and forecast ladders."),
("p", "The trichotomy is why the corpus never confuses three different refusals: “no exact lift” (an obstruction), “no cheaper lift” (a frontier), and “no cheaper search for the lift” (a hardness wall). The five-way obstruction taxonomy of the astra synthesis — insufficient information, incompatible local obligations, ineffectivity, insufficient implementation resources, irreducible approximation error — is the diagnostic version of the same discipline, and it is actionable: a failure caused by missing information will not disappear through better optimization, a failure caused by insufficient memory does not require new sensors, and an inconclusive numerical abstraction is not a proof that the underlying mechanical specification is impossible. The governing principle is uniform across the corpus: diagnose the obstruction before choosing the repair."),
